---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy — Veena's School of Indian Dances" description="How Veena's School of Indian Dances handles enrolment details, photos and consent.">
  <PageHero title="Privacy Policy" lead="Plain-English privacy for a small dance school. Demo policy — replace with the client's final policy before launch." />
  <section class="px-4 py-12 sm:px-6"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-5 leading-relaxed text-ink/75">
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-ink">What we collect</h2><p>When you book a trial or enrol, we collect parent/guardian name, contact details, student age, course and experience level — only what we need to place a student in the right class and contact you about it.</p>
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-ink">Photos & children</h2><p>We photograph classes and performances only with written parent/guardian consent. We never publish children's surnames. Consent can be withdrawn at any time and photos will be removed from our channels on request.</p>
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-ink">What we never do</h2><p>We never sell personal information. Enrolment details are shared only with the teachers of the relevant class. This demo website stores nothing — its forms do not transmit data.</p>
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-ink">Contact</h2><p>Privacy questions: info@veenasschoolofindiandances.com.au or 0470 552 003.</p>
  </div></section>
</Layout>
